#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, welcomeText)
#. +> trunk
#: startpage.ui:65
msgid ""
"<h3>Create and Share Plasma Addons</h3>"
"\n"
"<p>\n"
"With Plasmate, you can easily create your own Plasma Add-Ons, for example Plasma written in Qt Quick, JavaScript, Python or Ruby. Plasmate guides you through the process of importing an existing Add-On or creating a new one from scratch, implementing your functionality, and exporting ready-to-install Plasma Packages, either to your computer, or publishing to the world using the Get Hot New Stuff System. <br />"
"\n"
"</p>"
"\n"
"<h3>Get started with Plasmate...</h3>"
"\n"
"<p>\n"
"<br />"
"\n"
"Plasmate provides all the tools you need to learn creating new Plasma Widgets.\n"
"<ul>\n"
"\t"
"<li>Follow a <b>Tutorial</b> to gather inspiration and find out how to turn your ideas into reality.\n"
"\t</li>"
"\n"
"\t"
"<li>Browse the online <b>Documentation</b> for information about the scripting API.</li>"
"\n"
"\t"
"<li>Work on your project in the <b>Editor</b> edit scripts and add resources.\n"
"\t</li>"
"\n"
"\t"
"<li><b>Preview</b> your widget as you work on it.</li>"
"\n"
"\t"
"<li><b>Export and Install</b> the result as a Plasma package.\n"
"\t</li>"
"\n"
"\t"
"<li><b>Publish</b> your creation via <i>Get Hot New Stuff</i>.\n"
"\t</li>"
"\n"
"</ul>"
"\n"
"Have fun creating!\n"
"</p>"
